# Files that run or are rendered on Linux keep LF on every checkout, including
# Windows with core.autocrlf=true. A CRLF startup-airflow.sh.tftpl made
# `terraform plan` rewrite the VM's startup script, and bash fails on "\r".
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.tftpl text eol=lf
*.tf    text eol=lf
*.tfvars text eol=lf
*.example text eol=lf
